  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "svalbard_vent_noise",
    "text": [
      "A slow, deliberate scratching starts up somewhere in the vent trunk, and stops the moment you hold your breath to listen.",
      "Something small and hard skitters the length of the ceiling duct, heading away from you.",
      "A vent grate rattles once, twice \u2014 then goes silent.",
      "From deep in the ductwork comes a sound like fingernails dragged along sheet metal.",
      "The ventilation shaft carries a sound up from below: a wet, patient sliding.",
      "Dust sifts down from the ceiling vent.  Something up there just moved."
    ]
  },
